#: templates/pages/privacy.html templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "Last updated: August 2026"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Afrikai Hajfonás (“we”, “us”) respects your privacy and is committed to "
"protecting your personal data in line with the EU General Data Protection "
"Regulation (GDPR). This policy explains what we collect, why, and the rights"
" you have over your information."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Data we collect"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"When you request an appointment, we collect only what is necessary to assess"
" and confirm your booking:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Contact details"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Name, email address, phone number, and age."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Hair information"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Hair length and three photos (front, side, back)."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Payment proof"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "A screenshot of your bank transfer as proof of deposit."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Booking details"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Chosen service, stylist, options, date, and time."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"We do not require you to create an account, and we do not collect more data "
"than is needed to process your request."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "How we use your data"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "To assess whether your hair is suited to the style you requested."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "To verify your deposit and process your appointment request."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"To communicate with you about your booking and any necessary follow-up."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "To meet our legal and financial record-keeping obligations."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"We do not sell your data and do not use it for unrelated marketing without "
"your consent."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid "Data retention"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"We keep your appointment information, hair photos, and payment proof for as "
"long as needed to provide our service and meet legal requirements. Photos "
"and booking records may be retained to support future consultations and to "
